<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem $250 mln debenture issue.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem $250 mln debenture issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Tuesday that on January 27 it will redeem the entire $250 million principal amount of its 8.60 percent debenture issue.</p>
<p>The debentures were to mature Jan 26, 2000.</p>
<p>They will be redeemed at a price equal to 100 percent of principal.</p>
<p>Payment of principal plus interest accrued to the redemption date will be made to shareholders of record as of the close of business on January 24, Freddie Mac said.</p>
</text>
